# Asteroid Lab invariants (MUST)



채팅 출력은 [shapez2-core.mdc](mdc:.cursor/rules/shapez2-core.mdc) Caveman 6절. **위반·의심**은 **## Risks**에 `invariant:` 접두로 적는다.



TDD·테스트 보호 대상 표: [testing.md § Domain invariants](mdc:documents/ai/manuals/testing.md#domain-invariants-that-must-be-test-protected).



| 주제 | MUST | Test / doc anchor |

|------|------|-------------------|

| **좌표** | Copy JSON `X`/`Y` = **island-local** (omitted→0; `X==0` valid). Persist/fingerprint: `island_bbox_left_bottom_raw_xy_v1` / `island_raw_xy_v1` (PR-F). RTTP solver default `CoordFrame.ISLAND_RAW`. Legacy server dense (`server_x`/`server_y` on JSON) — strangler only; new persist paths must not attach. World map: `x==0` 열 없음. normalize 이후 raw↔server 재변환 금지 (optimization). | [`research_shapez2_copy_json_island_local_coords_2026-05-23.md`](mdc:documents/research/research_shapez2_copy_json_island_local_coords_2026-05-23.md); [`2026-05-23-coordinate-tagged-frames-design.md`](mdc:docs/superpowers/specs/2026-05-23-coordinate-tagged-frames-design.md) |

| **Replay** | 스키마·append 의미 변경 시 버전·문서. payload **의미 대체** 금지. metrics/NDJSON/artifact는 **algorithm input 금지**. **단일 replay timeline**; 모든 프레임 2D `map_view`. | [`asteroid_lab_09_replay_timeline`](mdc:documents/Algorithm/asteroid_lab_09_replay_timeline.md); `test_manual_snapshot_replay_not_used_as_algorithm_input_doc` |

| **DTO·fingerprint** | `coord_system` 필수. Layout map v2 = island bbox-normalized; absolute v2 = island raw x/y. | [`layout_fingerprint.py`](mdc:django_apps/asteroid_lab/snapshots/layout_fingerprint.py); legacy server doc (historical) |

| **Export** | dense 앵커 export; [`sample_gene_exhaustive_generator`](mdc:django_apps/asteroid_lab/services/sample_gene_exhaustive_generator.py) NWS 배치는 **export 층만** 변경. | [`official_blueprint_canonical_export`](mdc:documents/ai/plans/official_blueprint_canonical_export.md) |

| **Candidate** | placement **commit 금지**. 생성 → local geometry → immediate route probe → reachable만 normal pool. | [`asteroid_lab_03`](mdc:documents/Algorithm/asteroid_lab_03_candidate_generator.md) |

| **Commit** | commit-time **latest `route_domain` re-probe**. `RouteDomainSnapshotBuilder.build_snapshot` **정본**; `build_commit_snapshot` 별도 semantics 금지. candidate reachable ≠ 최종 증명. | [`asteroid_lab_07`](mdc:documents/Algorithm/asteroid_lab_07_incremental_commit.md); `test_incremental_commit_reprobes_latest_domain` |
| **Fitness vs survivability** | `FitnessBreakdown` penalties = **predictive** (candidate probe). `CommitSurvivabilityMetrics` = **observed** — solver/GA/replay→input **금지**. | [`asteroid_lab_05`](mdc:documents/Algorithm/asteroid_lab_05_genome_fitness.md); [`asteroid_lab_10`](mdc:documents/Algorithm/asteroid_lab_10_development_sequence.md) §10B |
| **Replay truncation** | **Fixture envelope ≠ runtime persist.** Track `truncation_reason` from **last frame** `metrics`; top-level persist **금지**. | [`asteroid_lab_12`](mdc:documents/Algorithm/asteroid_lab_12_runtime_replay_wiring.md) §6.1; `test_build_lab_replay_truncation_surfaces_track_metrics` |
| **Evolution RNG** | `forced_distant_mutation` via **seed-stable hash** only; unseeded `random`/`uuid4` **금지**. v0: GA loop deferred. | [`asteroid_lab_06`](mdc:documents/Algorithm/asteroid_lab_06_evolutionary_search.md); `test_evolution_distant_mutation_slot_deterministic` |

| **Validation** | read-only assert; route·placement·topology **repair 금지**. | [`asteroid_lab_08`](mdc:documents/Algorithm/asteroid_lab_08_validation.md); [ADR-003](mdc:documents/adr/ADR-003-final-validation-assertion-gate.md) |

| **Lab replay timeline** | 제품 replay **하나**; global monotonic `frame_index`. **두 번째 optimization controller 금지**(목표). dual-track 정책 **폐기**. | `asteroid_lab_09_replay_timeline`; `test_lab_js_replay_wiring_smoke` |

| **Enums** | `issue_code`·`event_type`·`failure_reason` 등 **StrEnum/const** — 자유 문자열 금지. | Phase DTO 문서; `test_invalid_event_type_rejected` |

